  "captions": [
    {
      "text": "Can flood control actually work in",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 1.915
    },
    {
      "text": "the Philippines?",
      "start": 1.94,
      "end": 2.56
    },
    {
      "text": "And how would you prove your",
      "start": 3.16,
      "end": 4.635
    },
    {
      "text": "street is safer?",
      "start": 4.66,
      "end": 5.72
    },
    {
      "text": "In February 2025, heavy rain hit",
      "start": 6.2423,
      "end": 9.1973
    },
    {
      "text": "Tennessee's Cumberland River Basin.",
      "start": 9.2223,
      "end": 10.962299999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "The Army Corps published this comparison.",
      "start": 11.8823,
      "end": 13.6223
    },
    {
      "text": "Blue shows the river with flood",
      "start": 14.4823,
      "end": 16.037300000000002
    },
    {
      "text": "projects operating.",
      "start": 16.0623,
      "end": 17.1823
    },
    {
      "text": "Red shows the estimated flooding without",
      "start": 18.1223,
      "end": 19.9173
    },
    {
      "text": "them.",
      "start": 19.9423,
      "end": 20.5023
    },
    {
      "text": "The red is a model estimate,",
      "start": 21.3023,
      "end": 22.802300000000002
    },
    {
      "text": "not a second recorded flood.",
      "start": 23.1823,
      "end": 24.7423
    },
    {
      "text": "The Corps estimated $734 million in",
      "start": 25.3423,
      "end": 29.3973
    },
    {
      "text": "avoided damage across the basin.",
      "start": 29.4223,
      "end": 31.142300000000002
    },
    {
      "text": "That was a preliminary analysis.",
      "start": 31.9823,
      "end": 33.6823
    },
    {
      "text": "In the Philippines, an evaluation of",
      "start": 34.0223,
      "end": 36.237300000000005
    },
    {
      "text": "the Imus project reported improvement",
      "start": 36.2623,
      "end": 38.097300000000004
    },
    {
      "text": "through interviews.",
      "start": 38.1223,
      "end": 39.3423
    },
    {
      "text": "But comparable flooded area and household",
      "start": 40.1023,
      "end": 41.9973
    },
    {
      "text": "measurements were unavailable.",
      "start": 42.0223,
      "end": 43.3423
    },
    {
      "text": "That gap does not mean zero",
      "start": 44.2552,
      "end": 46.1702
    },
    {
      "text": "benefit.",
      "start": 46.1952,
      "end": 46.7152
    },
    {
      "text": "Ask for the event record, the",
      "start": 47.2511,
      "end": 49.7661
    },
    {
      "text": "with and without comparison, and checks",
      "start": 49.7911,
      "end": 52.5661
    },
    {
      "text": "against actual observations.",
      "start": 52.5911,
      "end": 54.1711
    },
    {
      "text": "How much safer, for whom and",
      "start": 55.1292,
      "end": 57.7242
    },
    {
      "text": "how do you know?",
      "start": 57.7492,
      "end": 59.37922916666667
    }
  ],
